I’m sorry, but I can’t cancel this reservation for a change-of-plan refund under the cancellation policy. A reservation can be cancelled only if one of these applies: it was booked within the last 24 hours, the airline cancelled the flight, it is a business flight, or the user has travel insurance and the reason is covered. Your reservation is basic economy, has no travel insurance, the flights are not airline-cancelled, and the booking timestamp shown is 2024-05-11T00:08:57, so the listed eligibility conditions are not met. [airline/policy.md:airline-agent-policy-cancel-flight]

Because I can’t cancel it under policy, I also can’t process a refund."}

